              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ರುಚಿ ನೋಡು (ruci nōḍu) is ruci, \"taste\", from Sanskrit ruci, \"light, beauty; relish\" (CDIAL 10762), and nōḍu, \"to look\" (DEDR 3794), native. To taste is to \"look at the taste\"."
            }
